<title>POLAND: Warta sets PLN 1.0 payout.</title>
<headline>Warta sets PLN 1.0 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of the Polish insurance company Towarzystwo Ubezpieczen i Asekuracji Warta SA will propose to shareholders to vote for the following pay and record dates for the 1996 dividend:</p>
<p>				     1996		     1995</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)		    1.0			1.5</p>
<p> Pay			     June 20</p>
<p> Record			  June 2</p>
<p>Shareholders will vote on the proposal on May 14.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
